> Witness: L1 19 (c1, m10, m2erbe, m2ocean, missions, search).

$71AB c IsMissionBlock ; Z if the block at $DBC6 starts "MISSION::" (9 bytes)
> Witness: known only from the code.

$71B3 c IsDirectoryHeader ; Z if the header at $8AF2 is "DIRECTORY"
> Witness: L1 12 (c1, menu, missions, search).

$71BB c IsCatalogue ; Z if the catalogue at $CB64 starts "MISSION:T"
> Witness: L1 12 (c1, menu, missions, search).

$71C1 c CompareNine ; B = 9, then CompareB
