@module hud ; The panel: the weapon slots, their bars and the gauges
@about The weapon table $68AB has nine 6-byte records (one per weapon kind: slot marks, bar position, colour, count); the four loaded slots are $8368, 6 bytes each, with the ammunition at +5 ($836D for slot 1, death: 79 at frame 7939, 69 at 9939).
