$A114 c OpFillBackFacesClipped ; Opcode 20: fill the faces whose flag is 0, clipping at the near plane (FillFaceListClipped with `JP NZ`)
> Witness: L1 3323 (c1, death, missions, play, play2).

$A119 c OpPolarPoints ; Opcode 21 (n, next, frame table): n vertices from (angle, radius, height) triples, turned by the heading
> The frame (`$A12C`, the object record's +4, set by DrawObject `$B827`) picks a word of the table at IX+3: the address of n triples. Each gives x = r sin(heading + angle) / 128, z = r cos(...) / 128, y = height, stored from V32 downwards. Then IX = next. Mission 1 uses it once (`$EFC5`, a barrel run out in five frames).
> Witness: L1 4 (play2).

$A17C b ClipWindow 2 ; The 2D clip window: x max (`$FF`), y max (`$5F`), and the clipper's work words
> `$A17C` = 255 (bank 6 `$CA8B` sets 95 for the narrow console view), `$A17E` = 95; `$A180-$A183` hold the two points while ClipLine2D bisects.

