$C357 c CameraToPlayer ; Point the camera back at the player
> `$B9F4` = `$75F0`. Also called when a mission starts (15 runs over five recordings).
> Witness: L1 15 (death, m2erbe, missions, play, play2).

$C391 c DragonflyStep ; The Dragonfly's flight: steered by the controls
> Turns by the control input, MoveObject, height from the up / down keys (play: 25 runs).
> Witness: L1 25 (play).

$C3DE c LaunchMissile ; Launch a guided missile (no recording runs it)
> Reached from `$C171` and `$C25C` when a target was locked.
> Known only from the code: no recording runs it (static walk).
$C3F1 ; the Infinite Missiles POKE writes 0 here

$C453 b MissileCode 8 ; Missile step code no recording runs
