@module missionflow ; The mission goal: the pickup message, the Helicarrier, mission complete and failed
@about A mission's goal hook (the block's word at $DBE1, called from $6A66 every pass) sets the flag $68E8 when the goal objects are destroyed. Then PickupAnnounce $DB71 prints the message once, and the Helicarrier at the pad ($7E89 / $7E8C) takes the player away: mission complete through $67EE ($7040), the reason of a failure in $7BF9 and $7047.
$CE68 b DevMissionLoader 8 ; A development loader for "MISSHDR:0:" that nothing calls
> `$CE68`-`$CEA3`: IX = `$CE93`, DE = 17, LD-BYTES through `$86C1` with A = `$FF`, and the 10-byte name "MISSHDR:0:". No routine calls it; a leftover of the development.

