> The Helicarrier's collision handler, code no recording runs: when the hitter is not present (+3 bit 7 clear) HitTest; when `$68E8` is set JP `$67EE` (mission complete), else `$7047` with `$7BF9` = `$CC94` (failure). Then `$DAC4` turns it (+$22 + 8).

$DADE b HelicarrierLift 8 ; The Helicarrier's lift-off step (not run)
> The lift-off step, code no recording runs: height += 8 up to `$20`, then the next state.

$DB00 c HelicarrierInit ; The Helicarrier's set-up
> Clears `$6760`-`$6763`, `$FF` to `$6764`-`$6767`, the handler +$18/+$19 = `$DB24` (play: 1 run).
