> A NOP / RET gate at `$DB71`. When `$68E8` (the goal flag) is set: `$DB77` writes `RET` at `$DB71` and prints "MISSION:COMPLETE:PROCEED:TO:PICKUP" (`$DB97`). Runs once per 3D frame.
